    "content": "The domicile of origin prevails until a new domicile has been acquired.\n",
    "html": "<article class=\"provision\" data-n=\"9\" data-report=\"Section 9 · The Indian Succession Act, 1925\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"prov-head\"><h3 class=\"prov-title\"><span class=\"n\">9</span>Continuance of domicile of origin.</h3></div><p class=\"prov-cite\">Section 9  ·  Part II  ·  page 18 of the Act</p><div class=\"prov-body\"><p>The domicile of origin prevails until a new domicile has been acquired.</p></div></article>",
    "inner_html": "<div class=\"prov-head\"><h3 class=\"prov-title\"><span class=\"n\">9</span>Continuance of domicile of origin.</h3></div><p class=\"prov-cite\">Section 9  ·  Part II  ·  page 18 of the Act</p><div class=\"prov-body\"><p>The domicile of origin prevails until a new domicile has been acquired.</p></div>"
